{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877870/extras/59c5a4b6b2b65839d1c567c422f200a7.poster.avif?t=1773266250\" width=684 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877870/extras/59c5a4b6b2b65839d1c567c422f200a7.webm?t=1773266250\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877870/extras/59c5a4b6b2b65839d1c567c422f200a7.mp4?t=1773266250\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Could some legends be real? Imagine if technology priests once lived in the pyramids of Ancient Egypt. What if today's technology was actually created back then?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two of the forgotten gods of Ancient Egypt have awakened. But to unleash their powers, they need a third body. Will <i>you</i> be the third?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>The Third</strong>, you play as an archaeologist trapped in a mysterious temple where ancient powers are beginning to rise. With realistic graphics and a chilling atmosphere, this immersive horror experience will pull you deep into a world filled with forgotten rituals and eternal darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for a terrifying journey that blurs the line between myth and reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover ancient secrets, follow the clues left by those who came before you, and uncover horrifying truths. Explore cursed corridors, solve puzzles, and do whatever it takes to survive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877870/extras/7c255f9f90bfc92bb4bf0a9e8512b8ce.poster.avif